# Input graph for TDCC-NES__askwol__src_askwol_shacl_runner.py___prepare
# Covers: several solutions of the pattern the demo's query reads (ex:a,
# ex:b), the zero-solution case (a second query, in driver.py, against a
# type with no member), and neighbouring triples that must NOT match
# (ex:c, wrong type).
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

ex:a a ex:Thing ;
    ex:label "A" .

ex:b a ex:Thing ;
    ex:label "B" .

ex:c a ex:Other ;
    ex:label "C" .
